<p>Hi <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Someone asked to reset the password of your Roomies account. You can choose a new one on
  <%= link_to "this password reset page", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>.
</p>

<p>
  This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
  If you didn't ask for it, you can ignore this email: your password stays the same.
</p>
